    "How often brightness is sent to external monitors while dragging. Pick whatever looks smoothest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ドラッグ中に外部モニタへ輝度を送る頻度です。最も滑らかに見えるものを選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
